---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = 'Login Administrativo - 1IPIM';
const description = 'Igreja Presbiteriana Independente de Machado – Há 150 anos servindo a Deus e à comunidade.';
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} noindex={true}>
    <script is:inline>if (localStorage.getItem('1ipim_auth_nonce')) {
            window.location.href = '/portal';
        }</script>
<section class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-900 px-4 py-12 transition-colors" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk> <div class="max-w-md w-full bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-[2rem] shadow-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 dark:border-slate-700 p-8 md:p-10" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk> <div class="text-center mb-8" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk> <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 bg-[var(--color-brand)]/10 text-[var(--color-brand)] rounded-2xl mb-4" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk> <i class="fa-solid fa-lock text-2xl" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk></i> </div> <h1 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2 tracking-tighter uppercase" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk>Painel da Igreja</h1> <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk>Entre com suas credenciais para gerenciar reflexões e escalas.</p> </div> <form id="login-form" class="space-y-6" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk> <div data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk> <label for="username" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500 mb-2 ml-1" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk>Usuário ou E-mail</label> <div class="relative" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk> <span class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 pl-4 flex items-center text-gray-400" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk> <i class="fa-solid fa-user" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk></i> </span> <input type="text" id="username" name="username" required class="block w-full pl-11 pr-4 py-3.5 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-900/50 border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-xl text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[var(--color-brand)] focus:border-transparent transition-all outline-none" placeholder="ex: pastor_silva" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk> </div> </div> <div data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk> <label for="password" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500 mb-2 ml-1" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk>Senha</label> <div class="relative" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk> <span class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 pl-4 flex items-center text-gray-400" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk> <i class="fa-solid fa-lock" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk></i> </span> <input type="password" id="password" name="password" required class="block w-full pl-11 pr-4 py-3.5 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-900/50 border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-xl text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[var(--color-brand)] focus:border-transparent transition-all outline-none" placeholder="••••••••" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk> </div> </div> <div class="text-right -mt-2"><a href="/admin/wp-login.php?action=lostpassword" class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 hover:text-[var(--color-brand)] dark:text-gray-400">Esqueci minha senha</a></div> <div id="login-error" class="hidden animate-shake bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-900/20 border border-red-200 dark:border-red-800 p-4 rounded-xl flex items-start gap-3 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 text-sm" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk> <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation mt-0.5" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk></i> <p id="error-message" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk>Usuário ou senha incorretos.</p> </div> <div id="login-notice" class="hidden bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-900/20 border border-green-200 dark:border-green-800 p-4 rounded-xl text-green-700 dark:text-green-300 text-sm font-bold"></div> <button id="resend-verification" type="button" class="hidden w-full mb-3 bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-900/20 border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-800 text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-300 font-bold py-3 rounded-xl text-sm hover:bg-amber-100 dark:hover:bg-amber-900/40 transition-colors"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope-circle-check mr-2"></i> Reenviar confirmação de e-mail</button> <button type="submit" id="submit-btn" class="w-full bg-[var(--color-brand)] hover:bg-[var(--color-brand-dark)] text-white font-bold py-4 rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-[var(--color-brand)]/20 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2 group" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk> <span id="btn-text" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk>Entrar no Portal</span> <i id="btn-loader" class="fa-solid fa-circle-notch fa-spin hidden" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk></i> <i id="btn-arrow" class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk></i> </button> </form> <div class="mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-gray-100 dark:border-slate-700 text-center" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk> <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk>
Ainda não tem conta como voluntário?
<a href="/portal/cadastro" class="text-[var(--color-brand)] font-bold hover:underline ml-1" data-astro-cid-uaub6dnk>Solicite acesso aqui</a> </p> <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm mt-2"> Quer participar do Bible Rats? <a href="/bible-rats" class="text-[var(--color-brand)] font-bold hover:underline ml-1">Crie sua conta</a> </p> </div> </div> </section>
</Layout>

<script is:inline>
if (localStorage.getItem('1ipim_auth_nonce')) {
            window.location.href = '/portal';
        }
</script>

<script>
import '../../scripts/portal/login.ts';
</script>
